    "problem": "The deterministic coverage selector improves aggregate Top-5 metrics but does not preserve correct evidence reliably across projects.",
    "evidence": [
      "Aggregate Recall@5 increased by 5.71 percentage points and dropped Gold decreased from 17 to 13.",
      "Only the two origin projects, Hong Kong Center and Shenzhen Fenglong, improved at project level.",
      "Headquarters Base kept the same Recall but lost 10 percentage points of MRR; Lingshui lost Recall, MRR and nDCG.",
      "RET-GRAPH-DEV-B-Q008 had both Gold blocks in the candidate pool, but the selector promoted two generic submission clauses and removed the direct performance-bond return clause from Top 5.",
      "The shadow fact gate had a 23.53% false-sufficient rate and 42.86% false-insufficient rate, showing that surface slot coverage is not evidence sufficiency."
    ],
    "inference": "The candidate generation layer is already strong enough to expose most Gold evidence, but the selector overweights surface answer signals and can replace high-quality baseline anchors with semantically incomplete clauses. The improvement is origin-project concentrated and is not yet a general selector.",
